PAYTUNE — Complete website responsiveness and cross-platform compatibility
PAYTUNE should be designed as one complete responsive platform that works professionally on desktop, laptop, tablet, and mobile devices, not simply a desktop website that has been squeezed to fit a phone screen.

The same features, accounts, permissions, payments, media, creator tools, and administration functions should work consistently across supported devices. The layout should adapt to the screen, while the functionality remains consistent.
One platform. Every screen.
Desktop

Full navigation, expanded player, multi-column content and complete dashboards.

Tablet

Compact navigation, adaptive grids and touch-friendly controls.

Mobile

Single-column feeds, mobile navigation and full-screen media experiences.

Creator Studio

