- Block users from a channel.
- Enable slow mode.
- Restrict links and repeated messages.
- Set chat to followers-only or paid-attendees-only.
- End a broadcast immediately.
- Disable guest participation.
- Report suspected copyright infringement.
Platform moderation controls
- Global and country-specific moderation teams.
- Live stream monitoring and incident reporting.
- Copyright complaints and takedown procedures.
- Harassment, hate speech and dangerous-content policies.
- Age restrictions and content warnings.
- Emergency broadcast termination.
- Evidence preservation and moderation audit logs.
- Appeals and review procedures.
The Master Owner should be able to suspend a live session or creator when there is a serious policy violation. All such actions should be logged.
