Free live	Approved advertising may be displayed
Paid live event	No intrusive ads during paid viewing
Sponsored live	Clearly identify the sponsor
Free replay	Eligible advertising may be displayed
Paid replay	Ad-free playback by default


Potential advertising formats:
- Pre-roll advertisements before free live playback.
- Optional mid-roll breaks controlled by the broadcast format.
- Sponsored event banners.
- Sponsor logos and approved overlays.
- Post-stream replay advertising.
- Advertiser-sponsored creator events.
Do not insert disruptive ads in the middle of a live performance without the creator's configured permission. Track actual ad impressions and verified revenue rather than estimating revenue from viewer counts.
